From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: suvojeet-sengupta <suvojitsengupta21@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 15:15:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ravelin: Don't hold the CPUs above their lowest clock

The post boot script set scaling_min_freq to 672 MHz on the silver
cluster and 691.2 MHz on the gold one, values tuned for WALT. Without
WALT, schedutil raises the clock as the load needs, and the floor only
kept the silver CPUs from their 499.2 MHz step while the phone is idle
or lightly loaded. Leave both clusters at their hardware minimum from
boot; the perf HAL can still raise the floor for a boost.

Change-Id: I495e7364a7a19afbed48c8890596d926b015386b
---
 vendor/init/parrot/bin/init.kernel.post_boot-ravelin.sh | 2 --
 1 file changed, 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/vendor/init/parrot/bin/init.kernel.post_boot-ravelin.sh b/vendor/init/parrot/bin/init.kernel.post_boot-ravelin.sh
index 9528dc63..797bf1d5 100755
--- a/vendor/init/parrot/bin/init.kernel.post_boot-ravelin.sh
+++ b/vendor/init/parrot/bin/init.kernel.post_boot-ravelin.sh
@@ -84,7 +84,6 @@ echo "walt" > /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpufreq/policy0/scaling_governor
 echo 0 > /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpufreq/policy0/walt/down_rate_limit_us
 echo 0 > /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpufreq/policy0/walt/up_rate_limit_us
 echo 1094000 > /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpufreq/policy0/walt/hispeed_freq
-echo 672000 > /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpufreq/policy0/scaling_min_freq
 echo 85 > /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpufreq/policy0/walt/hispeed_load
 echo 0 > /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpufreq/policy0/walt/pl
 
@@ -93,7 +92,6 @@ echo "walt" > /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpufreq/policy$goldpolicy_id/scaling_gover
 echo 0 > /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpufreq/policy$goldpolicy_id/walt/down_rate_limit_us
 echo 0 > /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpufreq/policy$goldpolicy_id/walt/up_rate_limit_us
 echo 1190000 > /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpufreq/policy$goldpolicy_id/walt/hispeed_freq
-echo 691200 > /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpufreq/policy$goldpolicy_id/scaling_min_freq
 echo 85 > /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpufreq/policy$goldpolicy_id/walt/hispeed_load
 echo -6 > /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpufreq/policy$goldpolicy_id/walt/boost
 echo 0 > /sys/devices/system/cpu/cpufreq/policy$goldpolicy_id/walt/rtg_boost_freq
-- 
2.43.0

